    "items": [
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286386?u=bc4894b945491e0834d2306dade7fef748ddf698&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Added FF support for <code class=\"notranslate\">match-element</code> value of <code class=\"notranslate\">view-transition-name</code> property</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Tested, <a href=\"https://mdn.github.io/dom-examples/view-transitions/match-element/\" rel=\"nofollow\">with this demo</a>, in the following Firefox Browsers with the flag <code class=\"notranslate\">dom.viewTransitions.enabled</code>:\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Nightly 143.0a1 no flag needed</li>\n<li>Developer Edition 142.0b7</li>\n<li>Beta 142.0b7</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40479\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/40479/hovercard\">MDN issue #40479</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40708\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/40708/hovercard\">Content PR</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40707\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/40707/hovercard\">Firefox release PR</a></li>\n</ul>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27566",
            "title": "Added FF support for `match-element` value of `view-transition-name` property",
            "date_modified": "2025-08-12T16:35:48.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-08-12T16:34:02.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "dletorey",
                "url": "https://github.com/dletorey"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47647?u=2fbfc431a85d357f00c0146d5e55b425b7f00a3d&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-mixins-1/#defining-custom-functions\" rel=\"nofollow\">CSS custom functions</a> have <a href=\"https://chromestatus.com/feature/5179721933651968\" rel=\"nofollow\">landed in Chrome 139</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR adds a data point for each of the separate bits that make up this technology. Specifically, it adds data points for:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">@function</code></li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">type()</code></li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;dashed-function&gt;</code> (I was going to call this something like <code class=\"notranslate\">--*()</code> to be consistent with the way custom properties are represented, but I thought it would be better to use the type name from the spec, which is more descriptive anyway.)</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Note that this PR does not include data for the CSSOM representations of these CSS features, as they were already added to the data. These are as follows:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-mixins-1/#cssfunctionrule\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">CSSFunctionRule</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-mixins-1/#cssfunctiondeclarations\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">CSSFunctionDeclarations</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-mixins-1/#cssfunctiondescriptors\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">CSSFunctionDescriptors</code></a></li>\n</ul>\n\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n\n\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n\n",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27557",
            "title": "Chrome 139 CSS custom functions data",
